Fix 2 — lblSaveBtn.OnSelect, the Status line

Replace Status: A.StaTxt with:

'Status (psquad_status)': LookUp(Choices('Meeting Action Items'.'Status (psquad_status)'), Text(Value) = A.StaTxt).Value

Full child block:

ForAll(
    Filter(colEditActions, !Removed, !IsBlank(Trim(Descr))) As A,
    Patch(
        'Meeting Action Items',
        Coalesce(A.ActionRec, Defaults('Meeting Action Items')),
        {
            Name: A.Descr,
            'Action Description': A.Descr,
            Meeting: varSavedMeeting,
            'Assigned To': A.Assignee,
            'Status (psquad_status)': LookUp(Choices('Meeting Action Items'.'Status (psquad_status)'), Text(Value) = A.StaTxt).Value
        }
    )
);
